        {"zh": "盯着空无一人的地方，发出低吟声。", "en": "Stares at emptiness, making low moans."},
        {"zh": "坐在地上，发出沉重的呼吸声。", "en": "Breathes heavily on the ground."},
        {"zh": "倚靠在墙边，发出轻响。", "en": "leans against a wall, making soft sounds."},
        {"zh": "低头盯着手中的骨头。", "en": "Stares at bones in hand."},
        {"zh": "发出咕哝声，慢慢嚼着骨头。", "en": "Grunts, slowly chewing bones."}
      ]
    },
