        {"zh": "骨头的手很稳。", "en": "A skeleton's hand is steady."},
        {"zh": "这一箭带着锈。", "en": "This bolt is rusted."},
        {"zh": "地道到头了，你退不了了。", "en": "The tunnel ends—nowhere left to back into."},
        {"zh": "弦声一响，箭就走。", "en": "The string twangs and the bolt flies."},
        {"zh": "我等着你从盾后露头。", "en": "I wait for you to peek past the shield."}
